  "url": "http://www.eppeltone.in",
  "about": "Founded in 1977, Eppeltone Engineers Limited specializes in manufacturing electronic energy meters, including smart meters, alongside various power conditioning devices.[1]",
  "keyPoints": "Business Profile[1]\nEppeltone Engineers is engaged in the design, manufacturing, and supply of electronic energy meters, smart meters, and various power conditioning devices. The company primarily operates in the B2B segment, supplying to state electricity boards, central PSUs, DISCOMs, and turnkey contractors.\nTheir product line includes static watt-hour meters, smart meters, water meters, battery chargers, UPS systems, LED luminaires, BPL kits, IoT-enabled monitoring devices, etc. The company also offers services for data analysis, monitoring systems, rural power distribution franchise support, and smart grid enablement.[2]\nProduct Portfolio\na) Energy Meters:[2]\n Single-phase & three-phase static meters\n Smart meters (BIS 16444 compliant)\n Trivector and multifunction meters\n Solar meters\n Industrial meters\nb) Power Conditioning Equipment:[3]\nHigh-grade UPS systems\nBattery management systems and chargers",
